# Content

- Docs are MDX in `content/docs`, ordered by `meta.json`, loaded in `src/lib/source.ts`.
- Projects are `content/projects/*.mdx`, frontmatter only, validated by `projectSchema` in `src/lib/projects.ts`.
- Blog posts are MDX in `content/blog` (Fumadocs `add blog`). Routes are `src/app/(home)/blog`. Author key is `dimah`.
- Write only what is true of dimah-kz and the public repositories. No placeholder projects or invented biography.
- A new document-shaped section is a new Fumadocs collection, then a route. Not a hardcoded array in a component.
- Name, tagline, home copy, locale, direction, and profile links stay in `src/lib/site.ts`.
- Interface labels are `t` in `src/lib/i18n.ts`, with an `en` and a `fa` set. Add a label to both.
- Fumadocs APIs: https://fumadocs.dev/llms.txt

Guide: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
